{"ID":"20240522082230-53bxxsc","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082230-53bxxsc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082230-53bxxsc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522104619-ge4dbq3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522104619-8ky0hel\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1800,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522104902-gxfhogv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:298,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:298\u0026#125;","title":"風痱","type":"doc","updated":"20240522104915"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522104619-ge4dbq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-ge4dbq3","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"風痱"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-rpppehk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-rpppehk","updated":"20240522104630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l                  黃女士 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66歲  初診日期:99/04/10 星期六."}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-ko5nule","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-ko5nule","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"來診原因：半夜2點多醒來覺無力翻身、無法動彈、全身酸痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-3y68yf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-3y68yf8","updated":"20240522104649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(因之前有半夜發燒及全身痠痛經驗，故此次等到早上才告知家人，被送至西醫診所求治，醫師轉診至大醫院神經內科，因其肌肉緊縮、沒法做詳細理學檢查，又不像中風故沒有開立服用藥物，後由友人轉介至此)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-tmpckef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-tmpckef","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌稍胖淡紅、舌苔白"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-c6o9kvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-c6o9kvy","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便1日1-2行、大便軟、易流汗、手腳覺無力、全身酸痛、走路需人攙扶，她兒子說之前約每兩個星期半夜會發燒一次，服用西藥後退燒，曾至大醫院檢查             但查不出病因，拿了一疊醫院檢查病歷給我看，其中所寫曾懷疑第十二胸椎壓迫性骨折，但最後證實沒有。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-1hgai4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-1hgai4f","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右寸關濡右尺弱、左脈細無力"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-ddzzocf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-ddzzocf","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"風痱"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-bguht1f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-bguht1f","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小續命湯9克、石膏1克、乾薑1克、炮附子1.5克、當歸1克 3X6"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-iakxscu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-iakxscu","updated":"20240522104708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(告訴患者服藥後會汗出、不能吹風、飲食要清淡。小續命湯組成麻黃、桂枝、防風、防己、杏仁、黃芩、人參、甘草、大棗、川芎、白芍、附子、生薑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522104704-0rlax9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104704-0rlax9s","updated":"20240522104711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"古今錄驗續命湯組成麻黃、桂枝、當歸、人參、石膏、干姜、甘草、川芎、杏仁，治中風痱、身不自收，口不能言，冒昧不知痛處，或拘急不能轉側。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522104738-89tbk3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104738-89tbk3u"}},{"ID":"20240522104619-958sg0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-958sg0n","updated":"20240522104724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l                  黃女士 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66歲  二診日期:99/04/14 星期三."}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-2c3wssm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-2c3wssm","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"來診原因：半夜2點多醒來覺無力翻身、無法動彈、全身酸痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-z4b1dyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-z4b1dyy","updated":"20240522104729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(此次自己走路進診間、不用人攙扶，自覺身體比較有力氣，藥因ㄧ天服用四包已沒藥了，故再次就診。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-snx8p5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-snx8p5e","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌稍胖淡紅、舌苔白"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-nhi4wv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-nhi4wv9","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便1日1-2行、大便軟、易流汗、手腳仍覺無力、肩膀酸痛兩手上舉無力。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-je5d0dg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-je5d0dg","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右寸關濡右尺弱、左脈細無力"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-9lsj1ep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-9lsj1ep","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"風痱"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-4apbzju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-4apbzju","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黃湯7克、石膏1.5克、乾薑1.5克、當歸1克、川芎1克、人參1.5克、炮附子2克 4X7"}]},{"ID":"20240522104736-misqabo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104736-misqabo"}},{"ID":"20240522104619-hu8zx5f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-hu8zx5f","updated":"20240522104742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l                  黃女士 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66歲  三診日期:99/04/21 星期三."}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-fmv6e6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-fmv6e6f","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"來診原因：手腳覺無力、肩膀酸痛兩手上舉無力、全身酸痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-tu259ni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-tu259ni","updated":"20240522104751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(上次服科中藥粉自覺沒有進步，故建議她改用藥效較好的水藥且加針灸))"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-qtkbm65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-qtkbm65","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌稍胖淡紅、舌苔薄白"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-26sz6lb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-26sz6lb","updated":"20240522104802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便1日1-2行、大便軟、易流汗、手腳仍覺無力、肩膀酸痛兩手上舉無力、兩手指屈伸僵硬且痛、左膝痛"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(之前西醫診斷膝關節退化、有服用西藥)。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-282q32z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-282q32z","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右脈濡無力、左脈細無力"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-gsqeemv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-gsqeemv","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"歷節"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-ruibroy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-ruibroy","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左膝鶴頂、膝眼、陽陵泉透陰陵泉"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-jxwfaze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-jxwfaze","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝4錢、白芍4錢、知母3錢、生薑3片、白朮4錢、防風5錢、炙甘草4錢"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-gwtbjeb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-gwtbjeb","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黃2錢、炮附子3錢、牛膝3錢、秦艽3錢、桃仁2錢、紅花2錢、 當歸3錢、牡蠣(碎包)5錢"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-i15cpqh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-i15cpqh","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"七帖   6碗水煮成2碗水、早、晚飯前喝，服用時加一匙川烏蜜"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-tcz1g2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-tcz1g2d","updated":"20240522104808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l                  黃女士 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66歲  三診日期:99/04/28 星期三."}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-zrrlvzb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-zrrlvzb","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"來診原因：手腳覺無力、肩膀酸痛兩手上舉無力、全身酸痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-49p9yfr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-49p9yfr","updated":"20240522104811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(上次服藥後疼痛減少很多、已停服西藥止痛劑)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-mi6gs49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-mi6gs49","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌稍胖淡紅、舌苔薄白"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-yrjyi7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-yrjyi7x","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便1日1-2行、大便軟、易流汗、手腳覺無力、肩膀酸兩手上舉無力、兩手指屈伸僵硬、左膝痛減、胸悶。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-diqk6w7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-diqk6w7","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右脈細無力、左脈細無力"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-uxsdei1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-uxsdei1","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"歷節"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-tkui3cb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-tkui3cb","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝4錢、白芍4錢、知母3錢、生薑3片、白朮4錢、防風5錢、炙甘草4錢、麻黃2錢、炮附子3錢、杜仲3錢"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-de70mdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-de70mdn","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、秦艽3錢、桃仁2錢、紅花2錢、 當歸2錢、黃耆7錢、栝蔞實3錢、枳實3錢"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-iwkfxdb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-iwkfxdb","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"七帖   6碗水煮成2碗水、早、晚飯前喝，服用時加一匙川烏蜜"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-gt9ibfc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-gt9ibfc","updated":"20240522104815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(99.05.05星期三下午再次就診，量血壓125/75、平常服降血壓藥四分之一劑量，今日沒服降血壓藥告知可停服了，四日前有試停心悸西藥，但心仍動悸起來，                故仍繼續服用，現全身已不痠痛但覺身體及手仍有無力感，左膝稍痛可忍受，因水藥太苦要求服用藥粉，開給她七天藥粉。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-5k163x3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-5k163x3","updated":"20240522104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-9qn8gq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-9qn8gq8","updated":"20240522104818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"結語"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-mdetkpa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-mdetkpa","updated":"20240522104840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"1."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"99.04.29有空時電訪黃女士"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-41pd9el","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-41pd9el","updated":"20240522104825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(1.她回憶第ㄧ次發病是在一月底左右，傍晚4-5點左右突然發燒、心悸至西醫診所就診，醫師量有高血壓、拿了三天藥服用後就沒事了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-fvfddfg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-fvfddfg","updated":"20240522104827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2.到了99.02.13傍晚4-5點左右突然又發燒、心悸、頭暈至大醫院急診，醫師開兩天藥、因快過年怕沒藥，故至之前就診西醫診所再拿十天藥，此次有服用心悸及高血壓藥。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-0szouwr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-0szouwr","updated":"20240522104834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(3.過了10天、半夜1-2點發燒，又至西醫診所拿藥。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-xfqe3xi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-xfqe3xi","updated":"20240522104835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(4.約兩星期後半夜-2點突然發燒，自行服用普拿疼退燒，但此次發覺兩手上舉無力且會全身酸痛，至大醫院檢查有做過電腦斷層、X光、抽血檢查，但查不出病因。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-zg54gny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-zg54gny","updated":"20240522104837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(5.99.04.10此次發作沒有發燒只覺無力翻身、無法動彈、全身酸痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-aw61dcs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-aw61dcs","updated":"20240522104845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"由以上的發病經過、可看到風寒之邪入侵後，因為沒有妥善治療、導致其後ㄧ系列越來越嚴重的症狀，若當初ㄧ開始就使用發表藥，也許後續就不用以中藥來處理風痱及歷節的問題，可見感冒有時會引起大病，並非只要多休息及喝水就會好。此案例一開始只是俗稱的感冒，經治療後變成需服用心悸、高血壓西藥及要退燒用的解熱鎮痛藥，加上之前就服用膝關節退化藥、服用之藥物越來越多，可見是只能做症狀治療、並沒有找到真正的病因。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-deeeqhy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-deeeqhy","updated":"20240522104858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"99.04.23患者打電話來說喝了水藥之後，身體皮膚出疹子非常癢不能入睡，問是否對中藥過敏、告知她應是風寒病邪由裏出表的反應，是好現象不用怕應繼續服用，結果黃女士後來對我說有照常服藥但有抹止癢藥，過兩三天皮膚就不癢了，此次服藥後疼痛減輕很多，但仍感覺兩手無力、兩手指屈伸僵硬但不痛，身體仍有無力感。在行醫過程中此種服藥後出現比較劇烈的反應並不少見，有的病人根本不問醫師就不再回診、錯過了讓病更好的機會，那麼如何分辨疾病是向好或變壞？有位朋友說只要服藥反應過後，人覺得輕鬆就是向正面發展，若越來越疲勞就是不對"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104859-jp4t1qf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104859-jp4t1qf","updated":"20240522104906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 倪師文章曾提及服藥後反應摘錄如下"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522104902-gxfhogv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104902-gxfhogv","updated":"20240522104915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人服藥過程中,身體在恢復時,自然會產生一些因人而異的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"祛病反應"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":", 這些反應可能每天都不同,有時會下利,有時會暈眩,嘔吐,手腳發麻等等,這都是正常現象,因這是身體有能力在祛病,所以會有因人而異的反應出現,此時不用害怕,你只要自己檢查一下,是不是這些反應都出現在你的病兆所在呢?你就知道你如何了。曾經一位病人,她來看我時,抱怨自己便秘,一星期才上一次大號,結果吃完我的藥第二天就打電話來說,中藥的副作用她受不了,因為拉肚子了.於是我問她妳感覺如何?她說感覺非常好,體力都恢復過來了,讀者覺得我應該如何回答她呢?你們在吃西藥時沒有這類反應是因為"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"西藥只是在控制"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":",根本不是在治病,當然你會感覺到二者之不同。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104619-8ky0hel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104619-8ky0hel","updated":"20240522104917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"弟子 趙醫師 敬筆"}]}]}